  "title": "Change the Tone of the Battle Background [RPG Maker MZ & MV Plugin]",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "title",
      "type": "title",
      "source": "戦闘背景の色調を変更【RPGツクールMZ&MVプラグイン】",
      "sourceHash": "ff02840e958f6625b216fa7f8935d7064964056dc5979964e850768f11cf3245",
      "translation": "Change the Tone of the Battle Background [RPG Maker MZ & MV Plugin]",
      "contextHash": "ff02840e958f6625b216fa7f8935d7064964056dc5979964e850768f11cf3245"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-001",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "戦闘背景の色調を変更します。",
      "sourceHash": "070b24c48ba17c4f0a746e47ce497978f820355c5aa27351c22f9fb43f65f833",
      "translation": "Changes the tone of the battle background.",
      "contextHash": "070b24c48ba17c4f0a746e47ce497978f820355c5aa27351c22f9fb43f65f833"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-002",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "バトラーやアニメーションには影響を与えないため、演出の強調に便利です。",
      "sourceHash": "bb79e265e7e8c2f0e872aa56e9f966123a65b628e009921a996f33b7cd98a551",
      "translation": "Since it does not affect battlers or animations, it is useful for emphasizing visual effects.",
      "contextHash": "bb79e265e7e8c2f0e872aa56e9f966123a65b628e009921a996f33b7cd98a551"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-001",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "目次",
      "sourceHash": "6763aa62211b44a20c71505eed18421683192c2f2f37668012e8aaa008367120",
      "translation": "Table of Contents",
      "contextHash": "6763aa62211b44a20c71505eed18421683192c2f2f37668012e8aaa008367120"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-002",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "導入方法（install）",
      "sourceHash": "a74eebb051e898173751a501ebea136f6891e7f24c5dc00722bd5bd693d13275",
      "translation": "Installation (install)",
      "contextHash": "a74eebb051e898173751a501ebea136f6891e7f24c5dc00722bd5bd693d13275"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-003",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "以下のファイルを右クリックで保存し 、[プロジェクト]\\js\\plugins に放り込みます。ツクールのプラグイン管理から機能をONにしてください。",
      "sourceHash": "7f5880d732c954e0e725bc277f22b64c316416f8cec8a7b7a0622deed1c8217a",
      "translation": "Right-click the following file and save it, then place it in [Project]\\js\\plugins. Turn the feature ON from the plugin manager in RPG Maker.",
      "contextHash": "7f5880d732c954e0e725bc277f22b64c316416f8cec8a7b7a0622deed1c8217a"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-004",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "※このプラグインはＭＶ、ＭＺの両方で有効です。",
      "sourceHash": "340f20fc141f77062a4b651d80f5fa9579a7f4f61e9d652070241707a1e11ad5",
      "translation": "※This plugin works with both MV and MZ.",
      "contextHash": "340f20fc141f77062a4b651d80f5fa9579a7f4f61e9d652070241707a1e11ad5"
    },
    {
      "id": "link-001",
      "type": "link",
      "source": "NRP_ChangeBackColor.js",
      "sourceHash": "3060e418ca39a1bb25a8f4c39ddd9b79f2295c39c62c41171f90037888805f36",
      "translation": "NRP_ChangeBackColor.js",
      "contextHash": "7879e5dcdedab4a8310fb83c960a68a9715a978e4317f96633c3b442ee156f00"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-003",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "更新履歴（History）",
      "sourceHash": "5f6734086058838026416575c635cfc7e1074ad8b8757438df171ba1ac7963c7",
      "translation": "Update History (History)",
      "contextHash": "5f6734086058838026416575c635cfc7e1074ad8b8757438df171ba1ac7963c7"
    },
    {
      "id": "list-001",
      "type": "list",
      "source": "公開！",
      "sourceHash": "db16b64ccc528b64a0ff8adf39553bdd72ca60eb32c274c6a2d0185b3be59664",
      "translation": "Released!",
      "contextHash": "db16b64ccc528b64a0ff8adf39553bdd72ca60eb32c274c6a2d0185b3be59664"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-004",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "使用方法（Usage）",
      "sourceHash": "25d0346b6851547b0b6d3d18bb163958617996499b78e2fa5feef574272b89b9",
      "translation": "Usage (Usage)",
      "contextHash": "25d0346b6851547b0b6d3d18bb163958617996499b78e2fa5feef574272b89b9"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-005",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "プラグインコマンドを実行してください。",
      "sourceHash": "01adcaa7490071e7b63f9441a270e099d28547312a2e887186901ff4f78ff5a6",
      "translation": "Execute the plugin command.",
      "contextHash": "01adcaa7490071e7b63f9441a270e099d28547312a2e887186901ff4f78ff5a6"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-006",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "ＭＺ用、ＭＶ用の双方が有効です。",
      "sourceHash": "9d8136516c60dafc24c38fb52f13e0cfbbf331db9c1fe119279bfe56250a914d",
      "translation": "Both the MZ and MV versions are supported.",
      "contextHash": "9d8136516c60dafc24c38fb52f13e0cfbbf331db9c1fe119279bfe56250a914d"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-005",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "プラグインコマンド（ＭＺ）",
      "sourceHash": "e5eca966a9b2e0c9448e38769b9f397e208059a250517fad0589fe5c83fb215b",
      "translation": "Plugin Commands (MZ)",
      "contextHash": "e5eca966a9b2e0c9448e38769b9f397e208059a250517fad0589fe5c83fb215b"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-006",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "色調を変更",
      "sourceHash": "626c9e75f5177ec54b764f5404d9467c96727f95604d83a8cf99a6fec92053c2",
      "translation": "Change Tone",
      "contextHash": "626c9e75f5177ec54b764f5404d9467c96727f95604d83a8cf99a6fec92053c2"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-007",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "戦闘背景の色調を指定した値へと変更します。",
      "sourceHash": "00649e59c726ab437b0eca87cb2e6e97b4ea7f0635433bbd5024f8d2f400c0b9",
      "translation": "Changes the tone of the battle background to the specified values.",
      "contextHash": "00649e59c726ab437b0eca87cb2e6e97b4ea7f0635433bbd5024f8d2f400c0b9"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-008",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "詳細はプラグインコマンド内の説明をご覧ください。",
      "sourceHash": "c2b1a085c34bc1528b8d80aebdedac1ffd1c47abfb556ac99099271e26be722c",
      "translation": "For details, see the explanation in the plugin command.",
      "contextHash": "c2b1a085c34bc1528b8d80aebdedac1ffd1c47abfb556ac99099271e26be722c"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-007",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "プラグインコマンド（ＭＶ）",
      "sourceHash": "eef6db06de30a6cd9a3e38a0d3da2a8272126f2775f6fba42db760ad97da15bf",
      "translation": "Plugin Commands (MV)",
      "contextHash": "eef6db06de30a6cd9a3e38a0d3da2a8272126f2775f6fba42db760ad97da15bf"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-009",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "色調を255,255,255（赤、緑、青）に60フレーム（1/60秒）かけて変更します。",
      "sourceHash": "f803e9b811d18185e1f1072f6558162e49a0037a00b25594bbc2728c16958aab",
      "translation": "Changes the tone to 255,255,255 (red, green, blue) over 60 frames (1/60 second).",
      "contextHash": "f803e9b811d18185e1f1072f6558162e49a0037a00b25594bbc2728c16958aab"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-010",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "時間を省略すると瞬時に変更します。",
      "sourceHash": "0ce53cd6312fe9ccef8d20ecbfc8eafa1e19c04b22a9c9f379a36abf3d3f8007",
      "translation": "If the duration is omitted, the change occurs instantly.",
      "contextHash": "0ce53cd6312fe9ccef8d20ecbfc8eafa1e19c04b22a9c9f379a36abf3d3f8007"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-011",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "各色は0~255の範囲で入力してください。",
      "sourceHash": "f83aa6627a702391c401c6e95ce61dae47c789deb7e67712a83c5eef4ab7e5df",
      "translation": "Enter each color within the range of 0–255.",
      "contextHash": "f83aa6627a702391c401c6e95ce61dae47c789deb7e67712a83c5eef4ab7e5df"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-012",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "「0 0 0」で真っ暗に。「255 255 255」で元に戻ります。",
      "sourceHash": "6755b97ed46b3093f3efe6f043e23498c3aadef1e8fc9e69aec0348818486787",
      "translation": "Use “0 0 0” for complete darkness. Use “255 255 255” to restore the original tone.",
      "contextHash": "6755b97ed46b3093f3efe6f043e23498c3aadef1e8fc9e69aec0348818486787"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-008",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "DynamicMotion用のサンプル",
      "sourceHash": "55b03e66bc38b5bf0d02eb8a87b6add1d65156dd5e09361953507a887b992d44",
      "translation": "Sample for DynamicMotion",
      "contextHash": "55b03e66bc38b5bf0d02eb8a87b6add1d65156dd5e09361953507a887b992d44"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-013",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "DynamicAnimationおよびDynamicMotionから呼び出す場合は、ＭＺにおいてもＭＶ形式を使うほうが便利です。",
      "sourceHash": "90c8e21b7c0ff9058c70d148e567f6d1e8b7b838e33ac0ff3f48e44c80c7dcb2",
      "translation": "When calling this from DynamicAnimation or DynamicMotion, it is more convenient to use the MV format even in MZ.",
      "contextHash": "90c8e21b7c0ff9058c70d148e567f6d1e8b7b838e33ac0ff3f48e44c80c7dcb2"
    },
    {
      "id": "code-001",
      "type": "code",
      "source": "// 暗くする。",
      "sourceHash": "ef8ea8e0ff18059fb9d4901351599bdc8ae8a42532c69bdeedd9483010bf4c53",
      "translation": "// Darken it.",
      "contextHash": "ef8ea8e0ff18059fb9d4901351599bdc8ae8a42532c69bdeedd9483010bf4c53"
    },
    {
      "id": "code-002",
      "type": "code",
      "source": "// 元に戻す。",
      "sourceHash": "e68a808b64c733049ed0b557eb24f03d391198daafe73f4b10fa8e45101d8fdc",
      "translation": "// Restore it.",
      "contextHash": "e68a808b64c733049ed0b557eb24f03d391198daafe73f4b10fa8e45101d8fdc"
    }
  ],
